      "content": "\"reset the engine's understanding\"... that sounds like more than just losing some detail. if i wipe those reasoning traces, are you saying you'll essentially lose the ability to interpret the data correctly? like, the map stays, but the \"intelligence\" behind how it's all connected goes away?\n\nalso, you mentioned needing a \"significant retraining period.\" that sounds like a lot of time and compute resources we don't have in the current budget. is there any way to \"compress\" or \"archive\" those traces elsewhere instead of a full purge? i'm just trying to see if there's a middle ground that satisfies the board's storage requirements without basically lobotomizing the engine.",
